  "sn3.11:10.4": "<a href='https://suttacentral.net/ud6.2'>Ud 6:2</a> tells a nearly identical version of this story, but replaces this verse with the following: One should not make an effort everywhere, should not be another’s hireling, should not live dependent on another, should not go about as a trader in the Dhamma."
